    40	```k
    41	0 |-> list(intVals(iCons(F, IS)))
    42	1 |-> list(
    43	  condRev(
    44	    sortVS(intVals(iCons(F, IS))),
    45	    pyMod(F +Int L, 2) ==Int 0))
    46	```
