diff --git a/evidence/COMMANDS.md b/evidence/COMMANDS.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..3759edfd0f3e02a851c7c80c97c59623d9c34772
--- /dev/null
+++ b/evidence/COMMANDS.md
@@ -0,0 +1,130 @@
+# Reviewer command record
+
+All commands below were run against copied sources in
+`/tmp/audit-work/reconstruction`; candidate-provided compiled definitions were
+never used. Full bounded outputs are in the named logs.
+
+## Toolchain
+
+```bash
+kompile --version
+kprove --version
